          "en": "Central Army columns under Xue Yue, Zhou Hunyuan and Wu Qiwei pursued the Central Red Army from southern Jiangxi through southern Hunan and northern Guangxi into eastern Guizhou. The route is densified along major towns and road corridors but remains schematic and awaits historical review."
