          "en": "The Central Army’s 60th Division and other units, together with the Northeast Army, 40th Army, Shaanxi troops and Ma Hongbin’s 35th Division, pursued and blocked the Red 25th Army across the Henan-Shaanxi-Gansu border. The route is densified along major towns and road corridors but remains schematic; designations await page-level verification."
